<title>USA: McDonnell gets $233.5 mln defense contract.</title>
<headline>McDonnell gets $233.5 mln defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonnell Douglas Corp  has been awarded a $233.5 million U.S. defense contract to provide additional advance acquisition funding for 12 F-18E/F attack jets, the Navy said.</p>
</text>
